WEBVTT

00:02.820 --> 00:06.160
Since we stayed with Miss Hazelita 
and the others for a while,

00:06.160 --> 00:07.980
work certainly has piled up.

00:07.980 --> 00:11.790
It's comforting to be in our usual 
surroundings after some time away, but...

00:12.110 --> 00:16.370
<b>Laze...</b>

00:12.120 --> 00:13.860
Laze...

00:13.860 --> 00:16.360
Things seem to be operating 
as usual over there, too.

00:16.360 --> 00:20.570
Hazelita and Abel said 
they'd come see us soon,

00:20.570 --> 00:23.080
so my heart is at peace.

00:23.080 --> 00:26.640
Isn't it wonderful that you 
can still be together?

00:26.640 --> 00:27.590
Yes!

00:27.590 --> 00:31.320
While we were over there, 
you sat up straight most of the time.

00:31.320 --> 00:33.720
so you should let 
yourself relax for a while.

00:33.720 --> 00:35.140
I will!

00:41.240 --> 00:42.860
Slide...

00:42.860 --> 00:45.500
I'm not permitting quite 
that much relaxation.

00:45.500 --> 00:46.400
Oh?

02:17.240 --> 02:20.990
Episode 10

02:17.240 --> 02:20.990
Their Feelings

02:23.740 --> 02:26.730
Scones made by Lawren! It's been so long!

02:27.150 --> 02:28.080
What's this?

02:28.080 --> 02:30.260
There don't seem to be as many usual.

02:30.680 --> 02:32.280
Oh, that's right.

02:32.280 --> 02:34.670
It's because Abel and Hazelita aren't here.

02:34.670 --> 02:38.380
I nearly made the usual number by mistake.

02:38.380 --> 02:41.140
Looking at it like this... 
It is a little lonely, isn't it?

02:41.140 --> 02:42.480
Yes.

02:42.480 --> 02:44.440
<i>Now that I think about it,</i>

02:44.440 --> 02:48.190
<i>this means Lawren and I will be alone 
together for a while, doesn't it?</i>

02:48.360 --> 02:50.290
L-Lawren!

02:50.780 --> 02:53.120
Until those two come here again,

02:53.120 --> 02:56.620
it will be just the two of us 
in the house for a while, won't it?

02:57.520 --> 03:00.040
That's how it's been up 
until very recently, isn't it?

03:01.540 --> 03:03.100
<i>That's right.</i>

03:03.100 --> 03:06.160
<i>We've simply returned 
to the way things used to be.</i>

03:07.760 --> 03:11.320
<i>Originally, it was just us living here.</i>

03:12.230 --> 03:15.800
<i>The me who used to live alone together 
with Lawren was amazing!</i>

03:16.980 --> 03:22.110
<i>But the way Lawren fails to notice 
anything makes him the most amazing of all.</i>

03:23.550 --> 03:24.850
<i>For a little while,</i>

03:24.850 --> 03:27.940
<i>it will be all right for me to go 
to Lawren's side whenever I like.</i>

03:28.270 --> 03:31.610
<i>When he isn't busy, I'll go to him quietly.</i>

03:32.190 --> 03:33.440
1 hour later

03:33.840 --> 03:37.190
<i>He seems to have a lot of work right now.</i>

03:37.440 --> 03:38.690
2 hours later

03:38.700 --> 03:43.200
<i>Since he hasn't been able to clean, 
I suppose he does have to do it now.</i>

03:43.450 --> 03:44.700
A few hours later

03:46.160 --> 03:50.130
<i>It seems like Lawren 
will be busy all day today.</i>

03:50.590 --> 03:53.420
<i>I suppose I'll be good and help.</i>

03:55.830 --> 03:58.850
<i>Those two aren't here, which means...</i>

03:58.850 --> 04:03.350
<i>The lady saint was always with someone.</i>

04:03.350 --> 04:06.380
<i>Now, she seems lonely when I'm not with her.</i>

04:12.660 --> 04:17.610
In the end, I wasn't able to 
spend any time with Lawren today.

04:19.340 --> 04:23.110
<i>I don't know if that's the reason, 
but I simply can't fall sleep.</i>

04:26.010 --> 04:27.380
Lawren!

04:30.360 --> 04:31.450
What's that?

04:33.430 --> 04:34.700
Lady Saint?

04:34.700 --> 04:36.520
I-I'm sorry.

04:36.520 --> 04:38.360
I fell down the stairs, that's all.

04:38.970 --> 04:40.080
Are you all right?!

04:40.080 --> 04:42.450
You haven't hurt yourself anywhere?

04:45.380 --> 04:46.760
Lady Saint?

04:46.760 --> 04:49.560
Could it be that you've 
really hurt yourself?

04:49.560 --> 04:50.760
No.

04:50.960 --> 04:54.120
It's been a while since 
it was just us in this house,

04:54.120 --> 04:57.190
but I wasn't able to spend 
any time with you today.

04:59.280 --> 05:02.680
We were almost always in the 
same place, though, weren't we?

05:02.680 --> 05:05.150
But we were so far away from each other!

05:05.150 --> 05:07.030
Those standards are so high!

05:07.920 --> 05:10.280
When you say "together," do you mean...

05:10.770 --> 05:12.710
I-I'm so sorry!

05:12.710 --> 05:15.340
I didn't mean to say such selfish things.

05:17.330 --> 05:20.480
Well then, I'll get 
something nice ready for you.

05:22.400 --> 05:23.240
Here.

05:23.590 --> 05:26.470
Hot milk to help you fall asleep.

05:26.470 --> 05:29.040
Th-Thank you!

05:33.100 --> 05:37.700
Does something like this 
count as "being together"?

05:37.700 --> 05:40.640
Yes! I'm glad I was still awake.

05:40.640 --> 05:42.220
You're making too much of this.

05:42.220 --> 05:45.150
It will be just us two tomorrow, too.

05:45.820 --> 05:47.230
Well, I mean...

05:47.230 --> 05:50.820
spending as much time together 
as possible every day is the best, after all.

05:59.600 --> 06:01.580
Shall we go to sleep?

06:01.580 --> 06:03.090
We have tomorrow, too.

06:03.090 --> 06:04.600
I can still keep going!

06:04.600 --> 06:06.730
What are you trying to keep going for?

06:06.730 --> 06:07.920
Let's go to sleep.

06:08.680 --> 06:09.800
Please wait!

06:10.680 --> 06:11.600
Watch out!

06:13.090 --> 06:16.100
Lady Saint, if you suddenly 
grab me like that, I...

06:21.980 --> 06:23.480
I-I'm so sorry!

06:23.480 --> 06:25.500
You didn't hit your head, did you?

06:25.500 --> 06:28.080
Huh? Um, I-I'm all right.

06:28.080 --> 06:28.990
Yes.

06:29.580 --> 06:32.720
I'm sorry for pulling you. 
I'll go to sleep now.

06:32.720 --> 06:36.120
Um, all right. Good night.

06:39.190 --> 06:43.500
She was wobbling. Is she really all right?

07:00.360 --> 07:01.640
Lady Saint!

07:03.980 --> 07:05.570
Lady Saint?

07:06.920 --> 07:07.930
La—

07:10.350 --> 07:14.490
<i>I haven't managed to be face-to-face
with the lady saint all morning.</i>

07:14.990 --> 07:18.250
<i>And she's been behaving strangely 
since that moment last night.</i>

07:18.250 --> 07:20.630
<i>I wonder if that was the cause of all this.</i>

07:20.630 --> 07:22.100
Well, I mean...

07:22.100 --> 07:25.880
spending as much time together as 
possible every day is the best, after all.

07:25.880 --> 07:30.510
<i>The lady saint just said that she 
wanted to spend time together, and now...</i>

07:31.100 --> 07:36.020
<i>If those two were here now, 
what would they say to me?</i>

07:36.020 --> 07:37.170
<i>I don't know why,</i>

07:37.170 --> 07:39.550
<i>but even in my imagination, I can feel 
a sense of pressure from them.</i>

07:39.550 --> 07:41.760
Stare...

07:41.760 --> 07:45.360
<i>But if I make her some snacks 
the way I usually do, then...</i>

07:46.060 --> 07:50.020
Lady Saint! I've made scones and madeleines!

07:52.190 --> 07:55.610
<i>This situation seems dire.</i>

07:57.240 --> 07:59.520
<i>What do I do?!</i>

07:59.520 --> 08:02.000
<i>I can't look Lawren in the eye.</i>

08:02.000 --> 08:05.750
<i>I know it was my fault 
that things turned out that way, but...</i>

08:05.750 --> 08:08.340
<i>Oh, I have to try to act 
the way I always do!</i>

08:10.500 --> 08:11.980
<i>I just can't!</i>

08:12.920 --> 08:14.640
<i>What do I do?</i>

08:14.640 --> 08:17.880
<i>I've put her through 
something awful, haven't I?</i>

08:17.880 --> 08:20.890
<i>What can I do to calm myself down?</i>

08:23.350 --> 08:25.100
Not on the same page

08:25.290 --> 08:26.840
<i>Still...</i>

08:26.840 --> 08:29.360
<i>I have to make sure to do my job properly.</i>

08:29.610 --> 08:32.860
<i>And it seems like the lady 
saint will help me, too.</i>

08:32.860 --> 08:36.080
<i>That means I should be able to 
concentrate on my work!</i>

08:37.360 --> 08:39.360
<i>I'll finish up my work properly...</i>

08:39.360 --> 08:42.420
<i>and when we get back home, 
we'll talk things out!</i>

08:44.360 --> 08:47.790
<i>I do need to do my job properly, though.</i>

08:47.790 --> 08:49.980
<i>If I handle things as crisply 
and formally as usual,</i>

08:49.980 --> 08:51.880
<i>it won't bother me at—</i>

08:57.430 --> 08:59.700
They're both behaving oddly.

08:59.700 --> 09:01.260
You don't think they've fought, do you?

09:03.720 --> 09:04.900
I'm sorry!

09:04.900 --> 09:06.760
Oh! Miss Fortune Teller?

09:06.760 --> 09:09.610
That was a surprise! It was you, Lady Saint?

09:09.610 --> 09:12.510
It's unusual for you to come to the church.

09:12.510 --> 09:15.570
It's just... my work isn't going so well,

09:15.570 --> 09:18.060
so I was wondering if maybe you 
might give me something to eat.

09:15.610 --> 09:21.740
<i>No Money</i>

09:18.060 --> 09:21.750
I-If snacks would do, we do give those out.

09:21.750 --> 09:25.670
Then, Lady Saint, 
will you take me to the pastor?

09:26.400 --> 09:30.450
Um, Lawren is right over there, so...

09:30.450 --> 09:31.750
What's this?

09:31.750 --> 09:34.960
Usually, you'd be very excited 
to take me to the pastor.

09:34.960 --> 09:36.300
That's right.

09:36.300 --> 09:40.480
Everyone's been saying that 
the two of you have been acting strangely.

09:40.480 --> 09:44.460
I-I think it's just me behaving strangely.

09:47.200 --> 09:49.960
No, that definitely seems weird, too.

09:50.890 --> 09:53.980
This is about him being 
dense again, isn't it?

09:54.290 --> 09:56.840
He's top tier dense when it comes 
to romance, after all.

09:56.840 --> 09:57.530
Right?

09:57.530 --> 09:59.020
B-But...

09:59.020 --> 10:03.560
Lawren does seem to know 
what exactly romance is!

10:03.560 --> 10:06.900
He shows signs that he understands 
what sweethearts and marriage are.

10:06.900 --> 10:09.890
He is a pastor, so he has to 
understand at least that much.

10:10.960 --> 10:15.860
Lawren doesn't seem to associate that 
sort of relationship with himself at all.

10:15.860 --> 10:18.150
Then all you can do 
is stop beating around the bush

10:18.150 --> 10:20.970
and work at making him 
make that association.

10:20.970 --> 10:23.440
That's what I'd like to say anyway.

10:23.440 --> 10:26.260
But your emotions are always 
pouring out for everyone to read,

10:26.260 --> 10:27.930
so doing more than this might not be...

10:27.930 --> 10:30.800
I'm usually restrained in my emotions.

10:30.800 --> 10:31.860
What?

10:31.860 --> 10:34.120
No. Restrained? That has to be a lie.

10:34.120 --> 10:36.270
Lady saints can't lie!

10:36.270 --> 10:37.400
There you go again!

10:37.400 --> 10:38.790
It's the truth!

10:39.360 --> 10:43.280
<i>I wonder why she won't talk to me.</i>

10:43.540 --> 10:45.800
<i>When you don't understand how someone feels,</i>

10:45.800 --> 10:48.200
<i>this is how anxious it can make you.</i>

10:49.590 --> 10:54.320
<i>All those emotions the lady saint 
has shown toward me...</i>

10:55.680 --> 10:59.490
<i>Did I accept them all the way I should have?</i>

11:01.040 --> 11:04.220
It's already sunset.

11:04.220 --> 11:08.550
I only just spoke with him about how it's 
just the two of us right now, and yet...

11:09.710 --> 11:11.310
Y-Yes?

11:11.310 --> 11:14.440
Um, it's time for dinner.

11:14.830 --> 11:19.170
You didn't hurt your head or neck 
or anything last night, did you?

11:19.170 --> 11:22.060
What? N-No, I'm not hurt!

11:22.310 --> 11:23.800
I'm so glad.

11:24.120 --> 11:29.370
I think you're probably avoiding me 
because of what happened then,

11:29.370 --> 11:32.860
but, um, I'm not exactly sure why.

11:33.450 --> 11:36.750
And if I apologized without 
understanding how you feel,

11:36.750 --> 11:38.540
I don't think it would be sincere.

11:38.540 --> 11:40.140
Lawren...

11:40.140 --> 11:43.140
I've been fretting about it all day,

11:43.140 --> 11:45.350
so I don't remember what I did at work.

11:45.350 --> 11:46.600
Lawren?!

11:47.040 --> 11:51.850
<i>He's been thinking about me all day?</i>

11:52.440 --> 11:54.840
I-I'm sorry!

11:54.840 --> 11:57.530
You haven't done anything wrong, Lawren.

11:57.530 --> 11:59.590
This is just me getting 
worked up on my own.

11:59.590 --> 12:00.780
On your own?

12:00.780 --> 12:05.190
You could say that I have trouble 
feeling settled when I see your face.

12:05.190 --> 12:07.200
It can't be. Do you hate me now because I—

12:07.610 --> 12:09.370
No, it's isn't like that!

12:15.760 --> 12:17.750
Lady Saint?

12:21.060 --> 12:25.520
So, the only one feeling unsettled 
was me after all, wasn't it?

12:25.520 --> 12:27.020
What do you mean?

12:29.880 --> 12:31.320
If I do this,

12:31.320 --> 12:35.720
do you still not understand 
why I couldn't face you?

12:37.870 --> 12:41.980
<i>Even if I do this, I'm sure 
Lawren won't understand.</i>

12:45.610 --> 12:47.760
L-Lawren?

12:47.760 --> 12:51.120
I do understand feeling unsettled now,

12:51.120 --> 12:54.240
but I'm not sure that doing 
that on purpose was quite...

12:54.840 --> 12:58.570
<i>Indirect statements don't work with Lawren.</i>

12:58.570 --> 13:02.000
One day he will understand 
how I feel about him.

13:02.000 --> 13:05.550
I truly believe that, so I don't 
think there's any need to worry.

13:05.550 --> 13:10.890
<i>But if I tell him now, 
my feelings might just reach him.</i>

13:11.450 --> 13:12.560
Lawren!

13:12.840 --> 13:14.310
I...

13:17.800 --> 13:19.310
I...

13:20.020 --> 13:22.880
I hope you'll take care of me 
for many years to come.

13:22.880 --> 13:24.440
<i>I can't say the words!</i>

13:24.440 --> 13:26.160
<i>That's right.</i>

13:26.160 --> 13:28.080
<i>Even aside from saying them to Lawren,</i>

13:28.080 --> 13:30.610
<i>I haven't been able to say them 
to anyone else either!</i>

13:30.610 --> 13:35.200
<i>Oh, but I feel like I've said something 
unbelievable in a roundabout way!</i>

13:35.200 --> 13:37.440
Of course I will.

13:39.320 --> 13:43.510
<i>I'm nearly certain that he 
doesn't understand what I meant,</i>

13:43.510 --> 13:45.880
<i>but it still makes me happy.</i>

13:45.880 --> 13:47.770
But, um...

13:48.380 --> 13:50.480
You won't avoid me anymore, will you?

13:50.480 --> 13:51.300
What?

13:51.570 --> 13:54.640
When you avoid me so blatantly like that...

13:54.640 --> 13:58.060
i-it made me feel lonely.

13:58.500 --> 14:02.040
You're the only person I have, 
you see, Lady Saint?

14:04.950 --> 14:07.200
I-I won't do that anymore!

14:08.210 --> 14:09.440
All right.

14:09.960 --> 14:11.990
Well then, let's have dinner.

14:12.440 --> 14:13.600
Together.

14:14.300 --> 14:18.710
<i>Lawrence was seriously 
depressed because of me...</i>

14:18.970 --> 14:21.310
<i>He smiled with relief because of me...</i>

14:21.710 --> 14:25.250
<i>Even though he's dense, that straightforward 
way he expresses himself is why...</i>

14:25.250 --> 14:26.880
I...

14:26.880 --> 14:28.740
Did you say something?

14:29.470 --> 14:31.210
N-No!

14:32.170 --> 14:35.220
<i>I should practice saying it.</i>

14:35.750 --> 14:37.920
<i>The lady saint is back to her usual self.</i>

14:37.920 --> 14:39.360
<i>I'm so glad.</i>

14:42.760 --> 14:45.740
<i>I suppose she isn't quite her usual self.</i>

14:46.430 --> 14:49.200
<i>Could it be that I...</i>

14:49.200 --> 14:51.910
<i>don't really understand 
the lady saint very well?</i>

14:52.950 --> 14:54.570
What flavor cupcakes shall we make?

14:54.570 --> 14:56.520
I'd like chocolate!

14:55.450 --> 14:56.950
Whew...

14:58.200 --> 15:00.960
Those look delicious...

15:08.650 --> 15:12.470
I feel like I've made 
that as neatly as Lawren would.

15:12.010 --> 15:13.800
<b>Messy...</b>

15:15.800 --> 15:18.220
The necklace Lawren gave me.

15:18.220 --> 15:21.800
Just looking at it makes me happy every day.

15:21.800 --> 15:23.770
Cecilia!

15:23.770 --> 15:25.620
Hazelita!

15:25.620 --> 15:28.920
You seem to be living 
as peacefully as usual.

15:28.920 --> 15:30.530
Now, Cecilia...

15:30.530 --> 15:33.810
Are you here because you've 
finished all of your tests?

15:33.810 --> 15:36.030
Yes. But more importantly...

15:36.030 --> 15:37.780
Welcome home!

15:39.330 --> 15:41.920
This isn't the lady's home.

15:41.920 --> 15:44.000
Abel! Welcome home to you, too!

15:44.000 --> 15:45.700
I'm back!

15:45.700 --> 15:47.540
M-More importantly...

15:47.540 --> 15:49.550
Just now, when I jokingly asked Lawrence,

15:49.550 --> 15:54.480
"Did anything happen 
with Cecilia while we were gone?"

15:54.900 --> 15:58.720
Something may or may not have happened?

15:58.720 --> 16:01.430
That was his answer.

16:01.430 --> 16:05.060
Something may or may not have happened.

16:05.450 --> 16:08.230
I made Lawren feel lonely.

16:08.230 --> 16:09.540
Lonely?

16:09.540 --> 16:11.600
Miss, if you don't get 
your luggage in order soon,

16:11.600 --> 16:13.440
it'll get dark before it gets done.

16:13.440 --> 16:15.070
Th-That's true.

16:15.450 --> 16:16.830
Luggage?

16:16.830 --> 16:20.560
We've come to collect our luggage from 
when you let us stay here.

16:20.560 --> 16:23.060
We've rented a place 
in the village, you see.

16:23.060 --> 16:24.170
What?

16:24.170 --> 16:26.840
You aren't going to live 
here like you did before?

16:27.000 --> 16:30.930
We aren't going to be able to talk 
before bed anymore?

16:32.050 --> 16:35.410
Lady Saint, don't put them in a tight spot.

16:35.410 --> 16:36.680
Lawren...

16:36.680 --> 16:41.400
If you had even the slightest awareness 
that you are living with a young lady,

16:41.400 --> 16:45.070
the people around you wouldn't 
have to work this hard.

16:46.100 --> 16:48.680
Is that the plot of a novel or something?

16:48.680 --> 16:52.390
Once you've gathered up your things, 
please relax here for a while.

16:52.390 --> 16:54.310
I've made some snacks, too.

16:55.320 --> 16:58.150
Well, I am a little tired.

16:58.150 --> 17:00.330
The sun won't set for a while, surely.

17:01.570 --> 17:04.320
Hazelita, look at this!

17:04.320 --> 17:07.570
Lawren made these scones! They're delicious!

17:07.570 --> 17:09.330
I'm eating one right now.

17:09.470 --> 17:13.200
You won't believe this, 
but he's made us chocolate gâteau, too!

17:13.200 --> 17:14.630
It's delicious.

17:14.630 --> 17:16.350
I'll have some later.

17:16.350 --> 17:19.440
And the tea he's brewed 
for us is quite delectable as well.

17:19.440 --> 17:22.910
Lady Saint, if you could 
be just a little quieter.

17:22.910 --> 17:26.350
This is all quite nostalgic.

17:26.350 --> 17:30.100
And this is how the young lady 
shall grow in size and refinement.

17:30.100 --> 17:32.880
Who's going to grow in size?

17:32.880 --> 17:36.240
If we don't hurry up, 
the sun really will set.

17:36.240 --> 17:39.540
Then, I'll carry your things for you.

17:39.540 --> 17:42.040
I can carry that much myself.

17:42.040 --> 17:44.640
Why don't you carry Abel's for him, too?

17:42.830 --> 17:45.630
I can carry things too!

17:44.640 --> 17:47.620
If you're nice to him, 
he starts getting full of himself.

17:47.610 --> 17:50.630
Lawren, I can carry their luggage, too!

17:47.620 --> 17:49.650
Then I guess the lady will 
have to carry mine for me.

17:49.650 --> 17:52.470
I'm sure your baggage 
is all books, isn't it?

17:50.630 --> 17:52.980
I can carry luggage, too!

17:52.470 --> 17:54.540
You ate a lot earlier, didn't you?

17:53.630 --> 17:55.850
Luggage! Luggage!

17:57.880 --> 17:59.140
Luggage

18:00.030 --> 18:02.200
<i>So that's enough to make her happy?</i>

18:03.210 --> 18:05.680
Apparently, this is where 
we'll be living starting today.

18:05.680 --> 18:07.560
It's a beautiful place.

18:07.560 --> 18:11.930
Oh, if this is the place, 
there's a delicious restaurant nearby!

18:11.930 --> 18:14.930
Though, I wouldn't mind 
if you came and ate with us.

18:16.660 --> 18:19.940
I want to hurry up and see 
what your rooms look like.

18:19.940 --> 18:22.310
It's still a mess, you know?

18:22.310 --> 18:23.330
What's this?

18:23.680 --> 18:27.640
Abel, Hazelita, you decided 
to have neighboring rooms?

18:27.640 --> 18:29.240
Yes, that's because...

18:31.300 --> 18:34.230
in the morning, I can wake him 
quickly by punching the wall.

18:34.230 --> 18:36.670
<i>I think they might get kicked out quickly.</i>

18:38.800 --> 18:43.670
We've got some furniture together, 
but we haven't tidied up at all yet.

18:43.670 --> 18:46.450
Deciding how to decorate 
seems like it would be fun!

18:46.450 --> 18:48.410
Oh, right. Miss?

18:48.410 --> 18:52.940
Mister Giselbert said he'd very 
much like for you to display these.

18:57.300 --> 19:00.290
I think that having photos 
up would be very stylish!

19:00.290 --> 19:01.960
I think it's too late.

19:01.960 --> 19:04.970
I'm not good at interior design.

19:04.970 --> 19:07.950
I've always had the maids do that for me.

19:07.950 --> 19:09.910
When you're putting a room together,

19:09.910 --> 19:12.340
you can use your favorite 
color to unify things.

19:12.340 --> 19:16.210
And putting things like garlands 
and lamps around might be nice, too!

19:16.210 --> 19:17.420
Huh.

19:17.420 --> 19:19.300
That's Lawren for you!

19:19.300 --> 19:22.930
If you'd like, I've brought 
a garland I made...

19:23.950 --> 19:26.600
What did you bring here?!

19:26.600 --> 19:30.720
I'm sure you two must be busy, 
so please go home for today!

19:30.720 --> 19:34.080
Thank you for carrying our things for us!

19:34.080 --> 19:37.290
I-I'll come back, Hazelita.

19:37.290 --> 19:38.280
If you want a lampshade, these—

19:38.280 --> 19:40.160
Your thoughtfulness alone is enough for me!

19:43.080 --> 19:47.770
I'll have to make this a room one can relax 
in before the next time she comes.

19:47.770 --> 19:50.780
Have you gotten your 
room sorted out a little?

19:50.780 --> 19:52.160
Want to see?

19:53.660 --> 19:57.000
I feel like you'll bring bad luck
in with you, so never mind.

19:57.330 --> 19:58.520
What?

20:00.280 --> 20:02.880
I wonder why Abel and Hazelita went to

20:02.880 --> 20:06.430
the trouble of moving 
to apartments in the village.

20:06.430 --> 20:10.880
Was it somehow wrong for them to come 
live with us like they have until now?

20:10.880 --> 20:13.580
They said they wanted to draw a line.

20:13.580 --> 20:15.190
A line?

20:15.190 --> 20:18.680
At the house, I did most of the housework,

20:18.680 --> 20:22.320
and it seems to have made 
Hazelita feel beholden.

20:22.320 --> 20:24.950
She has a strong sense of 
responsibility, after all.

20:25.200 --> 20:27.660
Housework

20:25.200 --> 20:27.660
Beholden

20:27.660 --> 20:30.600
Oh! Lady Saint, there's 
no need for you to feel—

20:30.600 --> 20:34.920
E-Even so, I want Lawren to take care of me!

20:34.920 --> 20:35.790
What?

20:35.790 --> 20:37.800
N-Nothing!

20:37.800 --> 20:41.540
I hope Hazelita's room 
turns out wonderfully.

20:41.540 --> 20:43.040
Yes.

20:43.680 --> 20:48.540
<i>Now that I think about it, 
the lady saint's room is still very sparse.</i>

20:48.540 --> 20:55.310
Lady Saint, why don't you go and pick out 
some things for your room with Hazelita?

20:55.640 --> 21:01.070
I have what you gave me, Lawren. 
That's more than enough for me.

21:01.070 --> 21:01.960
What?

21:04.320 --> 21:06.570
But, um...

21:06.570 --> 21:09.010
may I have those, too?

21:09.840 --> 21:11.160
Of course!

21:12.400 --> 21:13.700
Miss!

21:13.700 --> 21:15.830
Have you reached a good stopping point?

21:15.830 --> 21:17.720
Not in the least.

21:17.720 --> 21:20.300
It's just about time for dinner.

21:20.300 --> 21:22.380
Shall we go eat at a restaurant?

21:22.380 --> 21:23.790
Or would you rather...

21:26.380 --> 21:27.980
Yes?

21:28.880 --> 21:29.680
Hey!

21:34.200 --> 21:35.700
Sorry to keep you waiting!

21:36.830 --> 21:38.620
I'm starving!

21:38.620 --> 21:40.930
That smells wonderful.

23:12.180 --> 23:15.030
Whew! I ate so much!

23:15.030 --> 23:19.740
I meant to draw a line, but I ended up 
indulging myself on the very first day.

23:21.220 --> 23:25.100
Thinking of the unpacking I have to do 
when I get back is so disheartening.

23:25.100 --> 23:28.070
And I have to procure carpet 
and curtains, too.

23:28.070 --> 23:29.760
What kind should I get?

23:29.760 --> 23:32.860
Cat print! You should use a cat pattern!

23:32.860 --> 23:35.140
Because you're a lot like a cat, Hazelita!

23:35.140 --> 23:37.560
In that case, I think 
a wild boar print would be good!

23:37.560 --> 23:39.410
What do you mean by that?

23:39.410 --> 23:41.410

